   "kapitel": 1,
   "start": 0.0,
   "dauer": 4.502,
   "emotion": "erzaehlend",
   "text": "Drop a concrete tube into the sea, and your family can drive underwater."
  },
  {
   "nr": 2,
   "typ": "meertunnel",
   "kapitel": 1,
   "start": 4.502,
   "dauer": 3.902,
   "emotion": "erzaehlend",
   "text": "But your tube is full of air. It won't sink. It floats."
  },
  {
   "nr": 3,
   "typ": "meertunnel",
   "kapitel": 1,
   "start": 8.404,
   "dauer": 5.294,
   "emotion": "erzaehlend",
   "text": "So you build tanks inside and fill them with water. Slowly, it sinks."
  },
  {
   "nr": 4,
   "typ": "meertunnel",
   "kapitel": 1,
   "start": 13.698,
   "dauer": 2.99,
   "emotion": "erzaehlend",
   "text": "But on the bare seabed, ship anchors would rip it open."
