   "kapitel": 2,
   "start": 44.962,
   "dauer": 4.094,
   "emotion": "erzaehlend",
   "text": "But between two pieces, there's a gap. The whole sea pushes in."
  },
  {
   "nr": 13,
   "typ": "meertunnel",
   "kapitel": 2,
   "start": 49.056,
   "dauer": 3.614,
   "emotion": "erzaehlend",
   "text": "So each end gets a thick rubber ring. You push them together."
